First Release of TAFileTagger.

Features:
 o Scrolling
 o Private Userarea without
   changes to the File.cfg,
 o Sysop Filearea without
   changes to the File.cfg,
 o Online FRequest Handling,
 o Sort the Files.bbs online,
 o Viewing texts,
 o Viewing archivs, therein
   reading texts,
 o Easy change to another
   area,
 o Language sensitive,
 o Groupstructure.
 o User can exclude Areas
 o File_ID.diz Support

